    "notes": "Single session date June 10, 1965 at Van Gelder Studio, Englewood Cliffs. Sources conflict on exact session date (some give June 14); MusicBrainz annotation resolves to June 10 per the Ruppli/Cuscuna Blue Note discography. Herbie Hancock plays organ on some tracks in addition to piano. Bobby Hutcherson doubles on marimba. James Spaulding doubles on flute."
  },
  "ballot": {
    "album": "Bobby Hutcherson — Components (1965)",
    "scope_check": {
      "in_window": true,
